WEBVTT

NOTE
This FMV depicts the first coupling sequence of the Timber train mission. The SeeD team's passenger train approaches the president's armored train from behind on parallel tracks. The camera captures the trains moving through lush green countryside at high speed. A mechanical coupling arm extends from one train toward the other as the daring operation begins.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Two trains race side by side along parallel railroad tracks. Lush green countryside stretches on both sides. Rolling hills and dense forest blur past. The sky is overcast and gray.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
The camera focuses on the SeeD team's civilian train approaching from behind. The president's heavily armored military train is ahead. The two trains accelerate as they draw parallel. Steel wheels pound against the tracks rhythmically.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Mechanical couplers and connecting hardware are visible on the sides of both trains. A mechanical coupling arm begins to extend from the SeeD train toward the president's train car. The arm moves with mechanical precision across the narrow gap between the trains.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The coupling arm reaches out further. The two trains maintain perfect parallel alignment. The countryside continues rushing past at high speed. Green fields and trees blur in the background.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The coupling arm extends nearly to the president's train. The mechanism is poised to lock onto the target car. The trains race forward in synchronized motion.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
A wider view of both trains moving together through the landscape. The coupling operation is in progress. Steel framework and railcars are visible against the green countryside backdrop.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The camera pulls back to show both trains from a distance. They move as two parallel lines of steel and engineering across the rural landscape. The horizon stretches far ahead.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Close-up of the coupling mechanism. Metal arms lock into position with mechanical precision. The connection between the trains is secured.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Both trains now move as a connected unit. The daring operation continues as the landscape races past. The sky and horizon shift as the trains navigate a gentle curve in the track. The scene fades as momentum carries them forward into the distance.
